\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Hail, gladdening Light, 
\par of His pure glory poured,
\par Who is the immortal Father, 
\par heavenly, blest,
\par Holiest of holies, 
\par Jesus Christ, our Lord!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Now we are come 
\par to the sun's hour of rest.
\par The lights of evening 
\par round us shine
\par We hymn the Father, Son, 
\par and Holy Spirit divine,
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Worthiest art Thou at all times 
\par to be sung With undefiled tongue,
\par Son of our God, 
\par giver of life, alone;
\par Therefore in all the world 
\par Thy glories, Lord, they own.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

